															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									BreathBound is a 1–4 player co-op horror game built on breath and sound management. In the dark, every breath, step, and collision can draw the Corpse King, who hunts by smell and hearing. Team up to gather resources, distract threats, and rescue each other—know when to risk it and when to retreat.								</div>
