				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>JOIN US</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5000870/extras/3d12d94e2f1c743dc93920f2ea6b65fe.avif?t=1793182678" width=800 height=220 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >- 1-4 player cooperative horror: survival depends on teamwork and role division.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >- Breath and sound exposure system: not just hiding from sight, but managing your breath and noise.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >- Sightless zombie hunting: the corpse king does not rely on vision, but on smell and hearing.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >- Chinese Hong Kong-style environments: ancestral estates, walled campus, public hospital, tong lau tenement buildings, and more.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >- Objective progression and rescue loop: sealing, rescuing, hunting, and delivery actions create high-pressure pacing.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >- Stream-worthy tension: running, gasping, collisions, bell ringing, and teammate chaos all make for memorable moments.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Special Note: Demo Completion Rewards Are Here! <u>(Claim them by logging in once the full game launches)</u></strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete the Normal, Hard, and Nightmare challenges in the demo to unlock exclusive in-game rewards for a limited time: </p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete Normal mode ➡️ </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock the “Companion” title and get a Black T-Shirt outfit.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete Hard mode ➡️ </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock the “Fearless Explorer” title, get a Black T-Shirt outfit, and unlock the exclusive “Come At Me!” emote.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete Nightmare mode ➡️ </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock the “Demon Queller” title, get a Black T-Shirt outfit, and unlock the exclusive “Talisman Seal: Freeze!” emote.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>The demo will close before the full game is released. All rewards above are in-game titles and skins, and can no longer be earned once the demo closes. Once you’ve earned the completion achievement, simply log in to the full game at launch to claim your rewards.</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5000870/extras/fbec8903c88bf113191391a3a7813011.avif?t=1793182678" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5000870/extras_big/fbec8903c88bf113191391a3a7813011.avif?t=1793182678 width=1560 height=606 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
